(D7 — Discrepancy 7 repro, this section's half of collections-a's D7:
 LANGUAGE.md:2680-2681 says "the same rendering appears inside the
 variable form of {...} format interpolation". It appears in PRINT
 position only. As a text initializer the same slot yields a raw heap
 address that changes every run, and the expression form yields one even
 in print position. Written as verdict lines so the probe is re-runnable;
 the raw values are the wandering part.
